This document tests WCAG 2.1 AA color contrast for links with various accent colors.

## Regular Paragraphs

Links should have sufficient contrast against their background. Here is a :url:https://example.com, regular link:: in a paragraph. Another :url:https://example.org, link here:: for testing.

## Within Theorems

:theorem:

  A theorem containing a :url:https://theorem-link.com, link:: to external content. The link should maintain sufficient contrast.

::

## Within Lists

:itemize:

:-: First item with a :url:https://list-link.com, link::

:-: Second item with :url:https://another-link.com, another link::

::

